    "body": "## Superseded by #182\n\nThis PR originally addressed authenticated route-quote existence enumeration by scoping user-facing quote lookups to the authenticated owner and returning a neutral not-found response for foreign quotes.\n\nPR #182 implemented the same privacy boundary, added runtime smoke coverage for both quote detail and mode estimates, documented the boundary, passed the full exact-head gate, and was merged to `master` as `69c436ea60726c081a06a82fb43f2a1273ff3cda`.\n\nClosing this PR without merge to avoid duplicating equivalent security changes on top of the already-merged fix.",
